spec/openapi.json is a verbatim OpenAPI document from Dagu
(https://github.com/dagucloud/dagu). Dagu states that its source is
GPL-3.0-or-later. The document's own info.version is 1.0.0. That field is the
spec version, not a Dagu server release.

spec/commands.json is derived from that document by scripts/command-map.py.
The derived command map is covered by the same GPL-3.0-or-later terms.

This program does not import or link Dagu's Go packages. It sends HTTP
requests to a Dagu server that you configure. Dagu's separate commercial
embedding license is not granted here and is not required to run this CLI
against a Dagu server.
